    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_usd0015eay](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_usd0015eay) Magnitude 5.7 earthquake at 35.585 depth occurred on Aug 17 2026 23km E of Mbay. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -8.5128 longitude 121.4731. It impacted 286103 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
